{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51663","headline":"隐岳洞（在石城山，五代时有隐岳寺） · 钱鏐","name":"隐岳洞（在石城山，五代时有隐岳寺）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺金容连翠岳，三层宝阁倚青霄。\n手炉香暖申卑愿，愿降殊祥福帝尧。\n（万历《新昌县志》三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}